{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["葡萄园之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我要为我所爱的歌唱，唱一首有关他葡萄园的歌：",{"text":"我所爱的在肥沃的山冈上有一个葡萄园。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他松土，清除石头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽种了上好的葡萄树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在园中建了一座瞭望塔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凿了榨酒池。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他期望收获好葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得到的却是坏葡萄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"他说，“耶路撒冷和犹大的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"请你们在我和我的葡萄园之间裁决。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不遗余力地料理葡萄园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"希望得到好葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么得到的只是坏葡萄呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"“现在，我告诉你们我会怎样处理这葡萄园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要除去篱笆，任它被毁坏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要拆毁围墙，任它被践踏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不再修剪，不再锄地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任由它荒废，长满荆棘和蒺藜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必禁止云朵降下雨水。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"万军之耶和华的葡萄园就是以色列家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂所喜爱的葡萄树就是犹大人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂希望看到公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却只看见杀戮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指望看到公义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，却只听见冤声。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的罪恶"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"那些不断建房置田、占光土地、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"独居其中的人有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我亲耳听到万军之耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“许多房屋必荒废，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豪华的美宅必无人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"十亩葡萄园只产一桶酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"二百升种子只产二十升粮食。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"那些从清早到深夜贪杯好酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝到酩酊大醉的人有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在琴、瑟、鼓、笛声中饮酒作乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不理会耶和华的作为，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全然漠视祂手中的工作。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"所以，我的子民必因无知而被掳。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的贵族饿得要死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"民众渴得要命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"阴间必敞开喉咙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"张开无边的大口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的首领、群众和宴乐之人都落入其中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人受羞辱，遭贬抑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狂妄者眼目低垂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有万军之耶和华因祂的公正而受尊崇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至圣的上帝借公义彰显自己的圣洁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，羔羊在那里吃草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如在自己的草场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寄居者在富人的荒场上进食。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"那些用虚假作绳子拽来罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用套绳拉来邪恶的人有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说：“让上帝快点，快点完成祂的工作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好让我们看看；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让以色列的圣者早点实现祂的计划，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好让我们知道。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些善恶不分、黑白颠倒、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甜苦不辨的人有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些自以为聪明、睿智的人有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些以豪饮称霸、善于调酒的人有祸了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们收受贿赂，释放罪人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不为无辜者主持公道。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"他们的根必朽烂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的花朵如飞尘飘落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像火焰吞灭禾秸，烧尽干草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们厌弃万军之耶和华的训诲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐视以色列圣者的言语。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和华向祂的子民发怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伸手击打他们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山岭震动，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们横尸街头，犹如粪土。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然如此，耶和华的怒气还没有止息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂降罚的手仍没有收回。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必竖起旗帜召集远方的国家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吹哨叫来地极的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，他们必飞速而来！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们无人疲倦，无人踉跄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人打盹，无人睡觉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都腰带紧束，鞋带未断。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的利箭上弦，引弓待发；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的马蹄坚如岩石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"车轮快如旋风。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们吼叫如狮子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吼叫像猛狮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们咆哮着捕食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将猎物叼走，无人能救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那日，他们必向以色列咆哮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如怒海澎湃。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人若观看大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只见黑暗和艰难，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"光明被密云遮盖。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":30}